    {
      "text": "Inside a tattered wisdom path Gu formation among the Gu formation remains in Snowy Mountain blessed land, Fang Yuan interacts with stored thoughts that speak of members called Yellow, Green, Purple, and Azure, and of seven people whose loss would hurt the whole group. He judges it a strong and mysterious organization, guesses that if they total seven members they probably use the colors of the rainbow, and says he will call the organization Seven Rainbows for now. The thoughts also mention Blue obtaining Old Immortal Kong Jue’s inheritance and Yellow with Purple obtaining an inheritance of Limitless Demon Venerable.",
